  "description": "Generic \"export the grid to Excel\" framework for Cargoflash RevenueForge microservices. Each service implements one IExportDataProvider adapter per exportable grid (delegating to its own existing paged repository query) and gets a full ExportAppServiceBase for free: row-count-based instant vs. background execution, MiniExcel streaming, blob-backed download tokens, and an ABP background job for large exports. Broker/host-agnostic: works standalone in a single microservice today and is designed to be re-hosted (e.g. behind a future Reports microservice) without changing consumers.",
